# Sensor Fusion and Advanced Control Lab

**Department of Electrical Engineering — Sharif University of Technology**

**Lab Director:** Dr. Behzad Ahi

---

## About

We focus on sensor fusion, state estimation, and advanced control methods, with applications spanning robotics, autonomous vehicles, and other systems.

## Current Projects

### Humanoid Robot Control
Control of humanoid robots using classical methods (Model-Predictive Control + Whole-Body Control) alongside Reinforcement Learning and Imitation Learning, supported by state estimation and contact detection algorithms. 

### Jetracer Control
Longitudinal and lateral channel control for the Jetracer autonomous racing platform.

### Cascaded ADRC
Theoretical development of Cascaded ESO-ADRC (Active Disturbance Rejection Control) controllers.

### Visual-Inertial Odometry
State estimation by fusing visual and inertial sensor data.
